  "id": "USN-8779-1",
  "summary": "bubblewrap vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that Bubblewrap incorrectly handled certain temporary\ndirectories. A local attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service or execute arbitrary code. This issue only affected\nUbuntu 18.04 LTS. (CVE-2019-12439)\n\nIt was discovered that Bubblewrap incorrectly handled certain symlinks\nduring sandbox setup. A local attacker could possibly use this issue to\ncreate files outside of the sandbox. (CVE-2026-87766)",
